"author"},{t="His islet lies off Theramore, an Alliance town whose guards attack you: come along the coast from the south and keep away from the town.",d=1,s="author"},{t="Sar'theris Strand, south of Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",w=1},{t="Fish there until Sar'theris Striker bites: only this stretch of water has it.",s="questie"},{t="The Savage Coast, south of Grom'gol in Stranglethorn.",w=1},{t="Fish there until Savage Coast Blue Sailfin bites: only this stretch of water has it.",s="questie"},{t="Misty Reed Strand, on the Swamp of Sorrows' east coast.",w=1},{t="Fish there until Misty Reed Mahi Mahi bites: only this stretch of water has it.",s="questie"},{t="The Verdantis River in Feralas, southeast of Dire Maul.",w=1},{t="Fish there until Feralas Ahi bites: only this stretch of water has it.",s="questie"},{t="Feralas lets fish get away until skill 300: Bright Baubles (75) or an Aquadynamic Fish Attractor (100) on your pole stop that.",tp=1,s="vmangos"},{t="Artisan Fishing comes from Nat Pagle's quest, not a trainer.",s="questie"},{t="Armand Cromwell, the fishing trainer, stands by the canal in the Magic Quarter.",w=1},{t="Mostly Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper, Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish and Raw Brilliant Smallfish here, and about 3 catches in 10 are junk.",s="vmangos"},{t="Nearly as safe, and you pass them on your way: Shadowprey Village and Booty Bay.",tp=1,s="vmangos"},{t="If you cook: Lizbeth Cromwell, fishing supplier, sells their recipes: Longjaw Mud Snapper (4 silver) and Brilliant Smallfish (40 copper).",s="questie"},{t="Lumak, the fishing trainer, stands by the pool in the Valley of Honor. Shankys beside him sells fishing supplies.",w=1},{t="Mostly Raw Longjaw Mud Snapper, Raw Bristle Whisker Catfish and Raw Brilliant Smallfish here.",s="vmangos"},{t="Nearly as safe, and you pass them on your way: Shadowprey Village and Booty Bay.",tp=1,s="vmangos"},{t="Lumak, the fishing trainer, stands by the pool in the Valley of Honor. Shankys beside him sells fishing suppl